OL,3,GNEWSADozens of illegal e-bikes and
OL,4,Ae-scooters seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have seized dozens of illegal
OL,7,Fe-bikes and e-scooters during a
OL,8,Fdedicated operation.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police (TVP) said
OL,11,Fofficers from its roads policing unit
OL,12,Fand its Oxford Cowley neighbourhood
OL,13,Fteam had confiscated 35 of the illicit
OL,14,Fvehicles in Oxford during the past
OL,15,Fweek.
OL,17,FThe force said many of the bikes it
OL,18,Fseized in the city had been modified to
OL,19,Ftravel at speeds "significantly above
OL,20,Flegal limits".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
