OL,3,GNEWSADozens of illegal e-bikes and
OL,4,Ae-scooters seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also stressed that under current
OL,7,Flegislation, privately owned e-scooters
OL,8,Fremain illegal to use on public roads,
OL,9,Fcycle lanes and pavements.
